   "body": "# Content licence — CC BY 4.0\n\nCopyright 2026 Ben Baichman-Kass\n\nThe **written and tabular content** of this repository is licensed under the\n[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n\nFull legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode\n\n## What this covers\n\nEverything that is writing or data rather than software:\n\n- `docs/` — working doc, research agenda, milestone plan, publishing policy\n- `literature/` — the literature matrix and all synthesis memos\n- `product-design/` — business plan and product-line documents\n- `data/` — all trackers (milestones, open questions, partners, PhD programs, product lines, resources)\n- `archive/` — archived source documents\n- `README.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and the skills in `.claude/skills/`\n\nSoftware — `dashboard/build.py`, `dashboard/index.html`, and any future analysis\nor modelling code — is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 instead. See\n`LICENSE`.\n\nWhere a single file is arguably both (the dashboard page contains prose), the\nApache licence governs the file and CC BY governs the prose it renders.\n\n## What you may do\n\nShare and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially, provided\nyou give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate if changes were\nmade.\n\n## Attribution\n\nA reasonable citation:\n\n> Baichman-Kass, B. (2026). *Sustainable Finance Venture: research and product\n> design for securitizing community-originated financial assets.*\n> https://github.com/benbaichmankass/sustainable-finance-venture\n> Licensed under CC BY 4.0.\n\n## What this does not cover\n\nThe literature matrix and memos summarise and cite works published by others.\n**Those works are not licensed by us.** They remain the property of their\nauthors and publishers under their own terms. What CC BY 4.0 covers here is our\nsummary, coding, relevance assessment and analysis — not the sources themselves.\n\nFull texts of cited sources are not distributed with this repository.\n"
